{"parentUuid":"f8050d48-34f7-45e4-bcac-535c013ad839","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b3e1e493-6a9a-40e3-b8e2-cca5b1711ec7","agentId":"abab904b048cba0e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DQCaMHh2PHEnZBMajXYwyC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"EVAP smoke machine price automotive diagnostic \"smoke machine\" cost $100 vs professional with flow meter UV dye\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"EVAP Smoke Machine Tester Automotive Pipe Vacuum Diagnostic Smoke Leak Detector\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.com/itm/234016484822\"},{\"title\":\"Automotive Smoke Machines for Leak Detection\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/c/kp/automotive-smoke-machine\"},{\"title\":\"Smoke Machine EVAP Leak Detectors for Vehicles\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/c/kp/smoke-machine-evap-leaks\"},{\"title\":\"ICON Diagnostic Smoke Machine\",\"url\":\"https://www.harborfreight.com/diagnostic-smoke-machine-59431.html\"},{\"title\":\"Automotive smoke machine Archives\",\"url\":\"https://shop.autooltech.com/product-category/auto-inspection-tools/automotive-smoke-machine/\"},{\"title\":\"Evaporative Emissions Smoke Tester - Advance Auto Parts\",\"url\":\"https://shop.advanceautoparts.com/c4/evaporative-emissions-smoke-tester/33775\"},{\"title\":\"Automotive Smoke Machines\",\"url\":\"https://www.autolinepro.com/collections/automotive-smoke-machines\"},{\"title\":\"$80–$150 EVAP Cost for U.S. Drivers: Why the 4 Step Scan Matters\",\"url\":\"https://www.expresslubeplano.com/blog/evap-smoke-test-cost/\"},{\"title\":\"EVAP Smoke Machine - Professional Car Diagnostic Tools\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.com/str/foxwelltool/EVAP-Smoke-Machine/_i.html?store_cat=37922542017\"}]\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"UV Smoke Producing Fluid 8oz\",\"url\":\"https://redlinedetection.com/products/uv-smoke-fluid\"},{\"title\":\"Tec1Tools UV Smoke Fluid Refill - Twin Pack 8 Oz Bottles for EVAP Smoke Machines : Automotive\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/Tec1Tools-UV-Smoke-Fluid-Refill/dp/B09GVTP7RS\"},{\"title\":\"OTC Tools and Equipment [P-0716-UV] ULTRATRACEUV DYE SMOKE SOLUTION ULTRATRACEUV Dye Smoke Solution -\",\"url\":\"https://www.toolsource.com/smoke-machines-c-102_403/ultratraceuv-dye-smoke-solution-p-96217.html\"},{\"title\":\"Replacement Flow Meter\",\"url\":\"https://redlinedetection.com/products/flow-meter\"},{\"title\":\"OTC 6522 Smoke Machine Leak Detection System with Flow Meter — 1SourceTool\",\"url\":\"https://1sourcetool.com/products/otc-6522-smoke-machine-leak-detection-system-with-flow-meter\"},{\"title\":\"Motorvac WV608 MotorVac Vacutec EVAP Smoke Machine With Flow Control (Low Pressure)\",\"url\":\"https://www.tooldiscounter.com/product/motorvac-motorvac-vacutec-evap-smoke-machine-with-flow-control-low-pressure-mtvwv608\"},{\"title\":\"Diagnostic Smoke® Test Machines\",\"url\":\"https://www.cpsproducts.com/products/diagnostic-smoke/\"},{\"title\":\"OTC P-0716-UV Ultra Trace UV Dye Smoke Solution\",\"url\":\"https://www.tooldiscounter.com/product/otc-ultra-trace-uv-dye-smoke-solution-otcp-0716-uv\"},{\"title\":\"UV KIT for Automotive Smoke Machine Leak Detection (Not for Ventus)\",\"url\":\"https://www.autolinepro.com/products/smoke-fluid-leak-tracing-uv-glow-8-oz-not-for-ventus-copy-1\"},{\"title\":\"UVIEW EVAP Smoke Machine\",\"url\":\"https://www.toolweb.com/mttgld50.html\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's a comprehensive comparison of EVAP smoke machine pricing across different categories:\n\n## Budget-Friendly Options ($45-$100)\n\nBasic AUTOOL automotive smoke machines start from around $46.97. The AUTOOL SDT206 model is available for $59.99, and other portable AUTOOL models range from approximately $52.60.\n\nAutoLine Pro's HyperSmoke smoke machine is priced from $59.99, and their newer Hypersmoke model is engineered for ultra-thick smoke output and sells for $89.99, delivering professional-grade results at a fraction of the price.\n\n## Mid-Range Professional Units ($100-$250)\n\nAUTOOL offers several models in the $69-$109 range, with options like the SDT102 at $79, and the SDT101 at $99. Some models like the ANCEL device with flowmeter have been discounted from $319.99 to $161.99.\n\n## Professional-Grade Systems ($600-$1,700+)\n\nThe ICON Diagnostic Smoke Machine costs $599.99. However, advanced professional systems are significantly more expensive: the OTC 6522 Smoke Machine with flow meter, which detects .020\" and .040\" EVAP leak sizes and includes UltraTraceUV dye, costs $1,689.76, and MotorVac Vacutec EVAP smoke machines with flow control are priced at $1,600.46.\n\n## UV Dye and Flow Meter Accessories\n\nReplacement flow meters that measure leaks as small as 0.010 inches cost $139.00. UV smoke producing fluid is $39.95 for 8 oz, while professional OTC UltraTraceUV dye solution is $99.96.\n\n## Professional Shop Diagnostic Costs\n\nThe typical cost for an EVAP smoke test ranges from $80 to $150, usually bundled with an OBD-II scan.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"436f400a-f49e-49a9-a91b-ac80ef4644a8","timestamp":"2026-10-08T09:46:45.939Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"EVAP smoke machine price automotive diagnostic \"smoke machine\" cost $100 vs professional with flow meter UV dye","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011oVcneA1y9HcHjpFhwDvWe","content":[{"title":"EVAP Smoke Machine Tester Automotive Pipe Vacuum Diagnostic Smoke Leak Detector","url":"https://www.ebay.com/itm/234016484822"},{"title":"Automotive Smoke Machines for Leak Detection","url":"https://www.walmart.com/c/kp/automotive-smoke-machine"},{"title":"Smoke Machine EVAP Leak Detectors for Vehicles","url":"https://www.walmart.com/c/kp/smoke-machine-evap-leaks"},{"title":"ICON Diagnostic Smoke Machine","url":"https://www.harborfreight.com/diagnostic-smoke-machine-59431.html"},{"title":"Automotive smoke machine Archives","url":"https://shop.autooltech.com/product-category/auto-inspection-tools/