nd Vacuum/Pressure Pump: $99.95\n- MV6870 1.3 Quart Hydraulic Brake & Clutch Kit: $99.95\n- MV7135 2.5L Vacuum Brake Bleed Kit: $158.99-$161.99\n\nThe prices vary depending on the retailer and specific model, ranging from around $50 to $160 for standard hand vacuum pump kits. The MV8000 model appears to be one of the most popular options, with prices ranging from approximately $50-$77 across different sellers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"bdc0d4de-96e4-478e-a16d-d33737b41085","timestamp":"2026-10-08T09:47:25.559Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Mityvac hand vacuum pump brake bleeder kit price","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WUPh5je5N8yeKMgGMUgNbG","content":[{"title":"Mity-Vac Vacuum Pump & Brake Bleeder Kit MV8000","url":"https://www.ebay.com/itm/282015751203"},{"title":"Mityvac Brake Bleeder","url":"https://www.ebay.com/shop/mityvac-brake-bleeder?_nkw=mityvac+brake+bleeder"},{"title":"Mityvac Brake Bleeder Automotive Brake Service Tools for sale","url":"https://www.ebay.com/b/Mityvac-Brake-Bleeder-Automotive-Brake-Service-Tools/179504/bn_117271232"},{"title":"MV8000 - MityVac Hand Vacuum Pump And Brake Bleeding Kit","url":"https://www.turnermotorsport.com/p-3657958-mityvac-hand-vacuum-pump-and-brake-bleeding-kit/"},{"title":"Mityvac Brake Bleeding Kits for Auto Care","url":"https://www.walmart.com/c/kp/mityvac-brake-bleeding"},{"title":"Mityvac Vacuum Brake Bleeder","url":"https://us.amazon.com/mityvac-vacuum-brake-bleeder/s?k=mityvac+vacuum+brake+bleeder"},{"title":"Mityvac Brake Bleed Kit","url":"https://www.source4industries.com/products/mityvac-brake-bleed-kit-mv8020"},{"title":"Mityvac MV8000 Selectline Hand Vacuum Pump Kit","url":"https://brakes4trailers.com/products/vacuum-brake-bleeding-kit"},{"title":"Mityvac MV8000 Automotive Tune Up And Brake Bleeding Kit","url":"https://www.tooldiscounter.com/product/mityvac-automotive-tune-up-and-brake-bleeding-kit-mitmv8000"}]}